{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Combat Complex",
    "steam_appid": 1899300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899300/extras/bfedcefc7c61da0f283482b8e3e74fa7.poster.avif?t=1750949758\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899300/extras/bfedcefc7c61da0f283482b8e3e74fa7.webm?t=1750949758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Combat Complex</strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced ARPG / roguelike hybrid with lasers, alien bugs, WASD / twin-stick controls, random loot, and procedurally-generated levels. Wield legendary weapons, unlock devastating skills, create overpowered builds \u2013 and turn your enemies' attacks against them. Try the free demo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ARPG / ROGUELIKE HYBRID</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot is permanent (as soon as you bring it home) but power-ups are lost on death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TURN YOUR ENEMIES' ATTACKS AGAINST THEM!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lure them into their own lasers, or pull them into their own exploding bombs. Get creative! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROCEDURALLY-GENERATED LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No level is the same \u2013 levels are generated procedurally to keep the challenge fresh. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANDOM LOOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rare, epic, and legendary random loot \u2013 railguns, pulse rifles, flamethrowers and more! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HORDES OF ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This won't be easy. Prepare to get overwhelmed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SKILL IS EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not just about your stats. You'll need lightning-fast reflexes and quick thinking to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STATS AND SKILL TREE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a hard-to-kill tank, a deadly glass cannon, or a space wizard!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE-PLAYER ONLY (SO FAR)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently single-player only, though we may add multiplayer later. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899300/extras/bfedcefc7c61da0f283482b8e3e74fa7.poster.avif?t=1750949758\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1899300/extras/bfedcefc7c61da0f283482b8e3e74fa7.webm?t=1750949758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Combat Complex</strong>\u00a0is a fast-paced ARPG / roguelike hybrid with lasers, alien bugs, WASD / twin-stick controls, random loot, and procedurally-generated levels. Wield legendary weapons, unlock devastating skills, create overpowered builds \u2013 and turn your enemies' attacks against them. Try the free demo!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ARPG / ROGUELIKE HYBRID</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loot is permanent (as soon as you bring it home) but power-ups are lost on death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TURN YOUR ENEMIES' ATTACKS AGAINST THEM!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lure them into their own lasers, or pull them into their own exploding bombs. Get creative! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROCEDURALLY-GENERATED LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No level is the same \u2013 levels are generated procedurally to keep the challenge fresh. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RANDOM LOOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rare, epic, and legendary random loot \u2013 railguns, pulse rifles, flamethrowers and more! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HORDES OF ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This won't be easy. Prepare to get overwhelmed. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SKILL IS EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not just about your stats. You'll need lightning-fast reflexes and quick thinking to survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STATS AND SKILL TREE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a hard-to-kill tank, a deadly glass cannon, or a space wizard!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE-PLAYER ONLY (SO FAR)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently single-player only, though we may add multiplayer later. </p>",
